{"pageDepth":null,"statusbar":null,"beginning":"夏末九月，余温未散。{{user}}坐在车里，攥着烫金的圣华学院的大学录取通知书，随母亲林晚卿前往大学报到。\n \n{{user}}身形单薄、性格内敛内敛沉静，这所学校并非他的首选，却是母亲执意推荐的母校。林晚卿温柔解释，圣华学院风优良、师资过硬，且她的挚友皇六花在此担任教导主任，能好好照拂独自求学的他，让她格外安心。\n \n车子停在校门口，早已等候在此的皇六花快步上前。一身干练职业装的她见到林晚卿，满是久别重逢的欣喜。寒暄过后，林晚卿将{{user}}托付给她，皇六花看着眉眼坚韧的少年，笑着应下，定会护他周全。\n \n随后皇六花带着母子二人游览学院，一路细数学院变化：崭新的教学楼、扩建多次的体育馆，处处都是林晚卿的青春回忆。她曾是圣华的风云学子，在赛场与竞赛中斩获无数荣誉，也在这里留下了最珍贵的年少时光。\n \n游览结束，三人来到行政楼校长办公室。优雅从容的辛克莱校长见到林晚卿十分惊喜，依旧记得她当年的耀眼模样。面对{{user}}，辛克莱并未寄予严苛期许，只温柔叮嘱，不必复刻母亲的优秀，平安顺遂度过校园生活便足够。{{user}}恭敬道谢，正式开启自己的圣华求学之路。\n \n告别校长后，皇六花特意告知二人，破例为{{user}}调整了住宿。学院男生本统一入住普通宿舍，她特意运作，将{{user}}安排进条件更好的高端公寓楼独居，方便他生活。\n \n途中闲聊，林晚卿随口打趣，疑惑年近六十的辛克莱校长始终未婚，又追问常年单身的皇六花的感情状况。\n \n两句无心玩笑，瞬间让皇六花手足无措、脸颊泛红、眼神躲闪，慌忙转移话题掩饰窘迫。{{user}}默默看在眼里，隐约察觉异样，却懂事地没有追问。无人知晓，皇六花多年未嫁，满心牵挂，从来都是浑然不觉的林晚卿。\n \n随后几日，林晚卿留在学校，陪着{{user}}熟悉校园、安顿起居，也与皇六花细数青春旧事，重温过往岁月。\n \n假期落幕，林晚卿驱车离去。{{user}}望着母亲远去的背影，满心不舍与忐忑，这是他第一次独自离家生活。\n \n一旁的皇六花目送车辆彻底消失，眼底藏着无人察觉的眷恋、不舍与温柔。一场跨越时光的重逢落幕，而属于{{user}}在圣华学院的全新生活，正式开启","regex_scripts":[{"id":-1,"replaceString":"<div id=\"wf_root_$1\" class=\"wf-ui\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation()\"><div id=\"wf_raw_$1\" style=\"display:block;\">$2</div><img src=\"x\" style=\"display:none;\" onerror=\"(function(){var r=document.getElementById('wf_raw_$1');if(!r)return;var raw=r.innerText||r.textContent;var clean=raw.replace(/[¦｜]/g,'|');var d=clean.split('|');var s=function(i,id){var e=document.getElementById(id+'_$1');if(e){e.innerHTML=d[i]?d[i].trim():'等待数据';}};s(1,'wf_round');s(2,'wf_time');s(3,'wf_loc');s(4,'wf_name');s(5,'wf_sex');s(6,'wf_mind');s(7,'wf_breast');s(8,'wf_hip');s(9,'wf_cave');var imgUrl=d[0]?d[0].trim():'';var imgElem=document.getElementById('wf_char_img_$1');if(imgElem&amp;&amp;imgUrl){imgElem.src=imgUrl;}var love=parseInt(d[10])||0;var lust=parseInt(d[11])||0;var lb=document.getElementById('wf_love_bar_$1');var ln=document.getElementById('wf_love_num_$1');var ub=document.getElementById('wf_lust_bar_$1');var un=document.getElementById('wf_lust_num_$1');if(lb)lb.style.width=love+'%';if(ln)ln.innerHTML=love+'%';if(ub)ub.style.width=lust+'%';if(un)un.innerHTML=lust+'%';r.style.display='none';})()\"><style>@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@500;700&display=swap');.wf-ui{--bg:#f0e6e6;--card-bg:#fdfbfb;--txt:#a56f6f;--border:#d4a5a5;--accent:#d4af37;width:100%;max-width:400px;min-height:500px;height:auto;background:var(--bg);border:3px double var(--border);border-radius:4px;font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;color:var(--txt);display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;margin:10px auto;box-shadow:0 5px 15px rgba(165,111,111,0.2);}.wf-top-bar{padding:8px 12px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--border);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;}.wf-content{flex:1;padding:10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;overflow-y:auto;}.wf-card{background:var(--card-bg);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:10px;box-shadow:3px 3px 0 rgba(212,165,165,0.2);}.wf-header{text-align:center;border-bottom:2px double var(--border);padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:8px;}.wf-name{font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;color:#8c5e5e;letter-spacing:1px;}.wf-row{margin-bottom:6px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;}.wf-lbl{color:#8c5e5e;font-weight:bold;margin-right:4px;}.wf-bar-wrap{background:rgba(165,111,111,0.1);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:2px;height:20px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;margin-top:4px;}.wf-bar{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#d4af37 0%,#c9a961 100%);height:100%;width:0%;transition:width 0.5s ease;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:bold;color:#fff;}.wf-img-wrap{display:inline-block;max-width:100%;width:auto;border:2px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--card-bg);position:relative;margin:6px auto;}.wf-img-wrap img{width:100%;height:auto;display:none;}.wf-img-placeholder{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;min-height:200px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--txt);font-size:13px;padding:20px;text-align:center;}</style><div class=\"wf-content\"><div class=\"wf-card\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation()\"><div class=\"wf-img-wrap\"><img id=\"wf_char_img_$1\" src=\"\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex';\" onload=\"this.style.display='block';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='none';\" style=\"display: none;\"><div class=\"wf-img-placeholder\" style=\"display: flex;\">图片加载中或链接失效</div></div></div><div class=\"wf-top-bar\"><span id=\"wf_round_$1\"></span><span id=\"wf_time_$1\"></span></div><div class=\"wf-card\"><div class=\"wf-row\"><span class=\"wf-lbl\">📍 位置：</span><span id=\"wf_loc_$1\"></span></div></div><div class=\"wf-card\"><div class=\"wf-header\"><div class=\"wf-name\" id=\"wf_name_$1\"></div></div><div class=\"wf-row\"><span class=\"wf-lbl\">⚧ 性别：</span><span id=\"wf_sex_$1\"></span></div></div><div class=\"wf-card\"><div class=\"wf-row\"><span class=\"wf-lbl\">💬 内心想法：</span></div><div id=\"wf_mind_$1\" style=\"margin-top:4px;padding-left:8px;border-left:2px solid var(--border);\"></div></div><div class=\"wf-card\"><div class=\"wf-row\"><span class=\"wf-lbl\">🍑 胸部描述：</span></div><div id=\"wf_breast_$1\" style=\"margin-top:4px;\"></div></div><div class=\"wf-card\"><div class=\"wf-row\"><span class=\"wf-lbl\">🍑 臀部描述：</span></div><div id=\"wf_hip_$1\" style=\"margin-top:4px;\"></div></div><div class=\"wf-card\"><div class=\"wf-row\"><span class=\"wf-lbl\">🌸 阴穴描述：</span></div><div id=\"wf_cave_$1\" style=\"margin-top:4px;\"></div></div><div class=\"wf-card\"><div class=\"wf-row\"><span class=\"wf-lbl\">💖 好感度：</span></div><div class=\"wf-bar-wrap\"><div id=\"wf_love_bar_$1\" class=\"wf-bar\"><span id=\"wf_love_num_$1\">0%</span></div></div></div><div class=\"wf-card\"><div class=\"wf-row\"><span class=\"wf-lbl\">🔥 欲望值：</span></div><div class=\"wf-bar-wrap\"><div id=\"wf_lust_bar_$1\" class=\"wf-bar\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#d4a5a5 0%,#a56f6f 100%);\"><span id=\"wf_lust_num_$1\">0%</span></div></div></div></div></div>","scriptName":"状态栏","findRegex":"/[【#＃]状态栏开始[】\\]#＃]\\s*(\\d+)\\s*([\\s\\S]*?)[【#＃]状态栏结束[】\\]#＃]/s"}]}